        "Luminous eyes provide superior low-light vision",
        "Heat-reflective silver-blue fur"
      ],
      "motorsport_disadvantages": [
        "Evolved in warm Thailand - cold sensitivity in winter rallies",
        "Paw numbness in extreme cold (Sweden, Monte-Carlo snow stages)",
        "Requires heated equipment more than other breeds",
        "Can become lethargic below 0°C"
      ],
      "optimal_rally_conditions": "Tarmac rallies, moderate temperatures, technical precision stages",
      "challenging_rally_conditions": "Extreme cold (Sweden -20°C, Monte-Carlo ice stages)",
      "cultural_notes": "Korat cats considered 'good fortune' breed in Thailand. In CWRC, represent passionate aggression (Thierry) and cold efficiency (Ott) - same breed, opposite expressions."
    },
    "turkish_van": {
      "drivers": ["Adrien Fourmaux", "Grégoire Munster", "Alexandre Coria", "Louis Louka"],
      "origin": "Turkey (ancient breed from Lake Van region)",
